OL,3,GNEWSAGeorge Square reopens after #20m  
OL,4,Arevamp - but council issues chewing gum
OL,5,Awarning                                
OL,7,FGlasgow's George Square has reopened   
OL,8,Fafter a delayed #20m revamp - but the  
OL,9,Fcity council has already had to issue a
OL,10,Fwarning about chewing gum being spat   
OL,11,Fout there.                             
OL,13,FThe city landmark closed at the start  
OL,14,Fof 2025 for work to begin, only for the
OL,15,Fproject to be delayed several times.   
OL,17,FIt has now reopened in full for the    
OL,18,Fcity's Christmas celebrations to take  
OL,19,Fplace.                                 
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
