OL,3,GNEWSAGeorge Square reopens after #20m  
OL,4,Arevamp - but council issues chewing gum
OL,5,Awarning                                
OL,7,FHowever the local authority criticised 
OL,8,F"disappointing and unacceptable"       
OL,9,Fbehaviour from people already spitting 
OL,10,Fgum out on the square since a phased   
OL,11,Freopening started in September.        
